Obtaining the PC binary Patchlevel 7 Nethack.
 
The PC team has packaged the patchlevel 7 binaries in an easy to
carry and install format.  The distribution includes two self-extracting
archives, a installion batchfile and a README file.
 
The preferred method for obtaining this package is either via your
favorite ftp site or from a friend.  However, if you find that you
cannot get it anywhere else, and you cannot wait until patch 8 (which
we hope to submit to c.b.i.p) the PC team has set up a semi-automated
mailing factility.  Following these instructions (to the letter) should
get you a set of uuencoded files in the mail complete with instructions
on how to recreate them on your system.
 
Send a letter to wizard@chemstor.uoregon.edu with the following line as
the first line of text.  Please do not quote this article in your reply.
(In capitals)
 
SEND PCNH307 you@your.address
 
If your address is one of those curious ones with multiple redirection
or if you have more than one, put down the one most likely to get
though and include the others in the body of the letter.  You will
automatically be sent a copy of the README file and if that doesn't
bounce the complete package will be forthcoming within a day or so.
(We don't want to have 600K mailings bouncing back at us, someone
could get crushed).
 
For the PC team,
 
